    intro: "Keep your heart with all vigilance, for from it flow the springs of life. What comes out of the mouth proceeds from the heart, and this defiles a person. For out of the heart come evil thoughts, murder, adultery, sexual immorality, theft, false witness, slander. Jesus taught that the real problem is not outside but inside. The same applies online: devices reveal and magnify what is in the heart.",
