    summary: "This session reviews lessons 1 to 12: technology as a gift and tool, seeing opportunities and risks, the heart behind the screen, parents modelling wise use, a household technology plan, rest and sleep, guidance for little children, older children and teens, tools and supervision, social media and identity, and gaming and entertainment. It prepares learners for the mid-session test.",
